---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../config";
---
<Base title="About">
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <!-- TODO: rewrite this in your own words. Keep it short. -->
    <p>
      I'm Fatih, a data engineer from Uzbekistan, living in Gdańsk for the last five years.
      I studied Data Engineering at Gdańsk University of Technology and have worked with
      data for about three years, mostly Python, PySpark, SQL, Databricks, dbt and Airflow.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside my day job I run Ferret Labs, a small data consultancy, and I've co-founded
      two products in Uzbekistan, Saqla and NavbatUz.
    </p>
    <h2>Why this site exists</h2>
    <p>
      Most interview advice is vague. I write up every interview I go through after the
      process ends: the stages, what they tested, where I struggled and what I'd prepare
      differently. I also keep notes on what I learn, written so that someone a year
      behind me can follow them.
    </p>
    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.links.linkedin
        ? <span>The easiest way is <a href={SITE.links.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>.</span>
        : <span>The easiest way is <a href={SITE.links.github}>GitHub</a>.</span>}
      {SITE.email && <span> Or email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</span>}
      {SITE.resume && <span> My resume is <a href={SITE.resume}>here</a>.</span>}
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-title { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3rem); margin: 2rem 0 2rem; }
</style>
